            "text": "<p>Maren killed her first twenty plants in a dark rented flat. Then she worked weekends in a plant shop, opened her own and spent eight years answering the same questions at the counter.</p><p>She now writes a short letter about plant care every other week. This is sample text. Replace it with your own story.</p>"
